WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.918
On Orders, the Dispatched tab lists what has left SASH Faridabad, but has not reached SASH US yet.

00:00:07.368 --> 00:00:11.675
Dispatch means part of the order was sent, and Dispatched means all of it.

00:00:12.127 --> 00:00:15.807
Orders fulfilled lists what John Deere has received in full.

00:00:16.258 --> 00:00:23.607
Columns adds Shipped Qty, Balance Qty and Outbound Qty, so you see what went on which invoice.

00:00:26.117 --> 00:00:29.744
Orders at Inbound or Partial outbound are on neither tab.

00:00:29.744 --> 00:00:32.799
Find them on All Orders, with the Status filter.

00:00:33.249 --> 00:00:38.160
On the Dashboard, In transit under Fulfilment counts every piece sent but not yet delivered.
